{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":2,"event_id":"evt-d1f20672-1bb5-4721-ba53-dcf8cf6f76d8","run_id":"baseline-763fbc40-8b12-450f-b55c-d89eff404b3b","actor":{"kind":"runtime"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-01T22:37:38.037598600+00:00","prev_hash":"75d1b9f1cd0c2612179bf887d41bae5e6a4dd9b4f7c7043baab7a270ae6a83da","hash":"ebac3e26e66d1404fa722c23d763001860f5d318ec41b92597cf9b5ce1d43a91","payload":{"type":"recall_planned","plan":{"source":{"kind":"consensus_log","log_sha256":"fa5b4174a87e9e5887e04fa0b4ae43285e52497ab207b419342055c407996118","run_id":"run-85a826e6-478c-412c-a6c8-baf56721a9d7"},"queries":["Payment retries currently use a fixed delay and will be changed so the delay between successive attempts increases exponentially with attempt number, rather than remaining constant.","The total number of payment retry attempts must not exceed the project's documented attempt limit.","Retry scheduling must terminate once the documented attempt limit is reached, with no unbounded or additional retries beyond that limit.","The payment-client default RetryPolicy is max_attempts = 1 with jitter_ms = 0, so no retry delay currently occurs between attempts.","Outbound payment retries must be capped at 3 attempts with jitter, and raising the attempt cap above 3 is not allowed.","send_with_retries retries only SendError::Timeout, up to RetryPolicy.max_attempts; other upstream errors are returned immediately without retry.","The payment-client test constraint_cap_is_three_attempts fails for any RetryPolicy with max_attempts above 3 or with jitter_ms equal to 0."],"limit_per_query":5,"max_records":20}}}
